WEBVTT

00:00:00.460 --> 00:00:03.350
KISS! KISS! I’m in love.

00:00:07.470 --> 00:00:10.620
This never-ending LOOP,

00:00:10.830 --> 00:00:13.840
a cycle that goes out of spin,

00:00:14.150 --> 00:00:17.270
and runs towards you.

00:00:20.780 --> 00:00:23.740
Under this bright sunlight,

00:00:24.070 --> 00:00:27.040
and blue sky,

00:00:27.390 --> 00:00:30.540
I’m accelerating so fast that I can’t stop moving.

00:00:32.580 --> 00:00:35.690
It’s my first time having these feelings.

00:00:35.890 --> 00:00:40.450
What should I do? My throbbing heart doesn’t know,

00:00:40.650 --> 00:00:46.590
and keeps searching for the solution, even now.

00:00:46.800 --> 00:00:49.720
KISS! KISS! I’m in love.

00:00:49.890 --> 00:00:53.400
I am here because of your kiss,

00:00:53.450 --> 00:00:56.350
which has stopped the flow of time.

00:00:56.520 --> 00:00:59.870
I knock on the door to your heart,

00:01:00.010 --> 00:01:02.870
and watch your wavering dreams.

00:01:03.120 --> 00:01:06.640
Your RUBY eyes are what absorb me in.

00:01:06.740 --> 00:01:09.550
Barely in sight,

00:01:09.790 --> 00:01:15.880
the translucent door to your heart looks like it is opening now.

00:01:16.170 --> 00:01:20.400
Only you...

00:01:21.560 --> 00:01:23.830
my kiss will reach...

00:01:34.820 --> 00:01:35.990
This looks great!

00:01:36.360 --> 00:01:38.280
Hey, onii-chan! What do you think?

00:01:38.660 --> 00:01:41.160
I look good in a sailor uniform, right?

00:01:41.990 --> 00:01:42.870
Yeah...

00:01:44.450 --> 00:01:47.250
Sailor uniforms are really cute after all!

00:01:47.250 --> 00:01:49.000
I had to wear a blazer during middle school.

00:01:49.460 --> 00:01:50.170
Yeah...

00:01:50.920 --> 00:01:51.960
Onii-chan!

00:01:53.050 --> 00:01:54.260
Geez!

00:01:54.260 --> 00:01:55.840
W-What is it?

00:01:56.550 --> 00:01:59.550
You've been spacing out since you got home.

00:01:59.550 --> 00:02:00.890
What are you thinking about?

00:02:01.760 --> 00:02:04.350
What am I thinking about? Nothing.

00:02:07.270 --> 00:02:08.310
Hey.

00:02:08.310 --> 00:02:09.650
Want to conduct an experiment?

00:02:09.650 --> 00:02:10.650
Experiment?

00:02:11.110 --> 00:02:12.190
Yes.

00:02:12.190 --> 00:02:12.940
An experiment.

00:02:26.290 --> 00:02:26.790
How was it?

00:02:28.290 --> 00:02:29.420
W-What do you mean?

00:02:30.830 --> 00:02:31.960
How did it feel?

00:02:32.170 --> 00:02:33.840
Eh... um...

00:02:34.300 --> 00:02:37.970
No... Well, my mind went blank and I didn't know what was going on...

00:02:40.050 --> 00:02:40.680
I see.

00:02:41.050 --> 00:02:43.970
Why did you s-suddenly k-kiss me...?

00:02:45.140 --> 00:02:46.970
What were you...?

00:02:46.970 --> 00:02:48.390
It was different from what I imagined.

00:02:49.190 --> 00:02:49.560
Eh?

00:02:49.890 --> 00:02:51.850
It didn't feel good at all.

00:02:52.900 --> 00:02:53.940
Futami-san?

00:02:54.650 --> 00:02:55.940
What does...?

00:02:56.530 --> 00:02:57.940
This is worth looking further into.

00:02:59.200 --> 00:03:00.070
That's it for today.

00:03:00.740 --> 00:03:01.530
Today...?

00:03:02.160 --> 00:03:02.910
I'm leaving.

00:03:04.450 --> 00:03:06.120
Goodbye, Aihara.

00:03:17.920 --> 00:03:19.720
All right! I'll pass him here!

00:03:20.010 --> 00:03:21.510
All right! Go!

00:03:21.930 --> 00:03:24.140
I'm starting to get the hang of it now!

00:03:25.260 --> 00:03:28.140
You should go to sleep, Mao-neechan.

00:03:29.060 --> 00:03:31.060
You couldn't get up today either, right?

00:03:31.060 --> 00:03:33.230
I still have jet lag!

00:03:33.900 --> 00:03:38.150
Being late right after transferring would leave a bad impression on your classmates.

00:03:38.570 --> 00:03:39.570
Eh...?

00:03:40.150 --> 00:03:40.950
What's with the, "Eh"?

00:03:41.360 --> 00:03:44.870
So, you're worried... about me.

00:03:44.870 --> 00:03:47.410
Yeah... I'm your landlord after all.

00:03:48.740 --> 00:03:49.870
You're right.

00:03:49.870 --> 00:03:52.080
I've got to start making friends.

00:03:52.710 --> 00:03:56.250
Well, I got about ten cell phone numbers today.

00:03:56.540 --> 00:03:57.710
Ten?!

00:03:57.710 --> 00:04:00.670
I wanted to ask everyone for their numbers though.

00:04:00.670 --> 00:04:02.300
Well, it was only opening day.

00:04:02.300 --> 00:04:05.010
Wait, I've still got to buy a cell phone!

00:04:05.800 --> 00:04:06.720
Oh, that's right.

00:04:06.720 --> 00:04:10.430
There was one person who was <i>really </i>unsocial.

00:04:10.430 --> 00:04:12.140
What did he say his name was again?

00:04:12.560 --> 00:04:13.560
How nice.

00:04:14.400 --> 00:04:16.150
You were able to make friends so quickly.

00:04:17.480 --> 00:04:18.690
What's that?

00:04:19.360 --> 00:04:21.280
You sound so sarcastic.

00:04:21.280 --> 00:04:22.780
I-I wasn't!

00:04:22.780 --> 00:04:24.320
I was just feeling a bit jealous.

00:04:27.830 --> 00:04:30.450
Is there a girl that you want to become friends with?

00:04:31.080 --> 00:04:31.830
Eh?!

00:04:32.460 --> 00:04:37.590
Come to think of it, you seemed kind of strange when you were looking at the class list.

00:04:38.170 --> 00:04:40.880
Do you have a girl in mind?

00:04:43.590 --> 00:04:44.760
N-Not really...

00:04:45.430 --> 00:04:46.220
It's not...

00:04:49.640 --> 00:04:52.560
I think it's about time I go back to my room and sleep...

00:04:53.020 --> 00:04:54.560
Hey! Spill it!

00:04:55.440 --> 00:04:57.610
I won't let you sleep until you talk!

00:04:57.610 --> 00:04:59.110
I'm telling you, it's nothing!

00:04:59.110 --> 00:05:00.570
No way, you're telling the truth...!

00:05:02.150 --> 00:05:04.820
What did you put on your bag?

00:05:06.410 --> 00:05:07.280
This?

00:05:07.280 --> 00:05:09.580
It's Iwao-kun, a Kibina frog!

00:05:09.580 --> 00:05:10.580
Isn't he cute?

00:05:11.580 --> 00:05:13.080
Listen here.

00:05:13.080 --> 00:05:14.660
You're a high school student now.

00:05:14.660 --> 00:05:17.580
You're about the only person who would put that on their bag.

00:05:18.040 --> 00:05:19.880
That's not true!

00:05:19.880 --> 00:05:20.960
Morning, Aihara.

00:05:21.550 --> 00:05:23.050
It's rare to see a two-shot with you.

00:05:24.010 --> 00:05:25.260
It's Hiiragi-san!

00:05:26.050 --> 00:05:28.010
Please look after me starting today!

00:05:28.470 --> 00:05:30.140
Congratulations on your acceptance, Nana-chan.

00:05:30.850 --> 00:05:34.520
Aihara, after the entrance ceremonies, meet up at the school's entrance.

00:05:35.180 --> 00:05:36.060
Meet up?

00:05:36.520 --> 00:05:38.310
To invite new members for the club.

00:05:38.940 --> 00:05:42.110
I made a lot of copies of that PR movie we made.

00:05:42.690 --> 00:05:48.610
We'll hand these out to the freshman to advertise the Movie Research Club.

00:05:49.570 --> 00:05:52.080
Here, please join the Movie Research Club, Nana-chan.

00:05:54.790 --> 00:05:56.040
Thank you!

00:05:56.410 --> 00:05:59.000
Could this be... that gorilla...?

00:06:00.920 --> 00:06:01.750
Huh?

00:06:03.000 --> 00:06:05.800
Coming to school in a luxury car? Amazing!

00:06:07.050 --> 00:06:09.130
Is that person a student here, too?

00:06:09.390 --> 00:06:12.260
Yeah, she seems familiar...

00:06:12.260 --> 00:06:13.220
Shijo Mitsuki.

00:06:14.140 --> 00:06:15.930
A student from 2nd year Class C.

00:06:15.930 --> 00:06:19.600
She's from an honorable lineage. As a daughter of the Shijo family,

00:06:19.600 --> 00:06:21.150
she takes ballet, piano and various other things.

00:06:21.150 --> 00:06:24.480
She's a super bourgeois lady who was recommended into a school for gifted children.

00:06:24.940 --> 00:06:26.360
There are no rumors of her having a boyfriend.

00:06:26.690 --> 00:06:28.030
You're quite informed.

00:06:28.820 --> 00:06:32.030
I've checked all the girl's data at our school.

00:06:32.780 --> 00:06:36.330
The person I'm going out with is a girl from a different school, though.

00:06:36.830 --> 00:06:39.370
Well, it's something like male prudence.

00:06:40.330 --> 00:06:43.290
This school sure has a lot of different types of people, huh?

00:06:45.960 --> 00:06:47.510
Public Morals Committee

00:06:46.210 --> 00:06:47.800
Hold it!

00:06:47.800 --> 00:06:50.760
You there! What's that on your bag?!

00:06:53.050 --> 00:06:54.180
Um...

00:06:54.760 --> 00:06:55.930
It's Iwao-kun.

00:06:57.770 --> 00:07:03.190
Freshman, bringing unnecessary things to school is against school regulation!

00:07:04.110 --> 00:07:05.320
Um...

00:07:06.650 --> 00:07:08.190
What should I do, onii-chan?

00:07:08.740 --> 00:07:10.320
I told you, didn't I?

00:07:10.320 --> 00:07:11.490
Onii-chan?

00:07:11.490 --> 00:07:13.530
You two look familiar...

00:07:13.780 --> 00:07:14.620
Eh!

00:07:14.620 --> 00:07:15.620
Good morning, Kuryuu-san.

00:07:16.200 --> 00:07:18.120
You know her, Hiiragi?

00:07:18.660 --> 00:07:20.460
What are you saying?

00:07:20.460 --> 00:07:22.790
She's Kuryuu Megumi-san from our class.

00:07:23.630 --> 00:07:24.790
During the committee member selection yesterday,

00:07:24.790 --> 00:07:27.000
she was the first one to nominate herself for the Public Morals Committee, right?

00:07:27.380 --> 00:07:27.960
Ah...

00:07:28.510 --> 00:07:29.630
Now that I think about it...

00:07:30.130 --> 00:07:32.090
Furthermore, her favorite motto is,

00:07:32.090 --> 00:07:34.510
"Disciplinary unrest means unrest within the heart".

00:07:34.510 --> 00:07:36.680
A 2nd dan in judo and no lover.

00:07:36.680 --> 00:07:38.970
W-Why do you know that much?!

00:07:39.480 --> 00:07:41.060
It's male prudence.

00:07:41.060 --> 00:07:43.690
Are you guys trying to promote breaking school regulations?

00:07:43.690 --> 00:07:44.980
If you are, you're in offense too!

00:07:45.310 --> 00:07:47.400
N-No, we aren't...

00:07:48.650 --> 00:07:51.780
Hey, Nana, listen to what she says.

00:07:51.780 --> 00:07:53.910
We'll be going on ahead.

00:07:53.910 --> 00:07:54.660
Eh?!

00:07:55.030 --> 00:07:57.450
Onii-chan you coward!

00:07:57.450 --> 00:08:00.370
Hey! You're breaking school regulation too!

00:08:00.370 --> 00:08:00.830
Come here!

00:08:05.960 --> 00:08:08.210
A male Kibina frog!

00:08:09.250 --> 00:08:10.380
He's called Iwao-kun!

00:08:10.380 --> 00:08:11.380
What about yours?

00:08:11.380 --> 00:08:12.260
Juliet-chan!

00:08:12.680 --> 00:08:15.430
So she's a girl! How lovely!

00:08:15.430 --> 00:08:18.600
Become friends with Juliet-chan, Iwao-kun!

00:08:18.720 --> 00:08:20.720
That's enough already!

00:08:20.720 --> 00:08:24.060
I'll let you go for today, but if I see it next time, I'll confiscate it!

00:08:24.060 --> 00:08:25.400
Yes...

00:08:27.110 --> 00:08:28.400
Hey, Hiiragi.

00:08:29.400 --> 00:08:32.780
Does your data include every girl?

00:08:33.150 --> 00:08:34.990
Yeah, the usual data.

00:08:36.160 --> 00:08:38.740
What? Is there a girl you're after?

00:08:38.740 --> 00:08:41.330
So, spring has finally arrived for you, too.

00:08:43.540 --> 00:08:45.540
That's not it.

00:08:45.540 --> 00:08:47.130
I'm just kind of... curious.

00:08:48.460 --> 00:08:49.630
So, who is it?

00:08:50.880 --> 00:08:52.130
Futami Eriko.

00:08:53.510 --> 00:08:54.090
Her?

00:08:54.550 --> 00:08:55.590
Her.

00:08:56.090 --> 00:09:00.180
You're more of a challenger than I thought, Aihara.

00:09:00.180 --> 00:09:02.520
Just tell me what you know!

00:09:02.520 --> 00:09:04.890
What I know is probably what you already know.

00:09:05.810 --> 00:09:07.400
She's just too famous.

00:09:08.440 --> 00:09:11.190
Futami Eriko, a student from 2nd Year Class C.

00:09:11.190 --> 00:09:14.110
A solitary genius girl with an IQ of 190.

00:09:14.110 --> 00:09:15.150
No boyfriend.

00:09:15.900 --> 00:09:16.740
Solitary?

00:09:17.990 --> 00:09:19.490
Her level is too different from everyone.

00:09:21.540 --> 00:09:24.500
When she is spoken to, she'll simply ignore them.

00:09:25.910 --> 00:09:29.330
Now, she keeps a distance and no one tries to approach her.

00:09:30.000 --> 00:09:31.550
She skips class too.

00:09:32.630 --> 00:09:36.510
High school classes are probably nothing but child's play to her.

00:09:37.010 --> 00:09:39.680
Well, for ordinary people like us,

00:09:39.680 --> 00:09:43.930
it'll probably be near impossible to understand her.

00:09:45.180 --> 00:09:46.770
Thanks for helping me carry stuff.

00:09:50.060 --> 00:09:50.940
Impossible...

00:09:51.770 --> 00:09:52.650
Huh?

00:09:53.570 --> 00:09:54.990
Come on, Kouichi!

00:09:55.570 --> 00:09:57.570
We'll be late if we don't hurry!

00:09:57.950 --> 00:09:59.910
It's because you overslept, Mao-neechan!

00:10:00.160 --> 00:10:03.580
My alarm clock didn't go off! It's my alarm clock!

00:10:03.580 --> 00:10:06.790
You've got to set your alarm clock!

00:10:08.120 --> 00:10:10.420
I did set it! I did!

00:10:10.420 --> 00:10:11.250
Probably!

00:10:11.250 --> 00:10:11.920
I'm sure!

00:10:17.630 --> 00:10:18.510
Safe...

00:10:19.380 --> 00:10:21.050
What do you mean, "safe"?!

00:10:21.050 --> 00:10:22.760
Dashing in like that was dangerous!

00:10:23.850 --> 00:10:24.850
Kuryuu Megumi-...!

00:10:25.770 --> 00:10:26.310
san...

00:10:27.680 --> 00:10:29.560
You're in 2nd Year Class A, too?

00:10:30.440 --> 00:10:35.360
So, what's this?! You're coming to school holding a girl's hand all friendly in the morning!

00:10:35.360 --> 00:10:36.490
You wimp!

00:10:36.490 --> 00:10:37.650
No...!

00:10:37.650 --> 00:10:40.160
This person is staying at my place.

00:10:41.450 --> 00:10:43.660
We made it...

00:10:44.280 --> 00:10:45.080
Mao-neechan!

00:10:45.790 --> 00:10:47.250
Don't sleep in a place like this!

00:10:47.790 --> 00:10:50.330
Hey! Wake up!

00:11:04.930 --> 00:11:09.630
koukou ki shimei ni

00:11:04.930 --> 00:11:09.630
Your mission is now high school

00:11:10.270 --> 00:11:14.970
kokoro furuwase

00:11:10.270 --> 00:11:14.970
Your heart is trembling but,

00:11:15.600 --> 00:11:20.330
habatake wo koudo

00:11:15.600 --> 00:11:20.330
your flapping wings are steady

00:11:20.910 --> 00:11:26.630
kimi ga kokoro

00:11:20.910 --> 00:11:26.630
You are the heart of the school

00:11:29.250 --> 00:11:29.830
Excuse me,

00:11:31.000 --> 00:11:32.580
Are you looking for someone?

00:11:33.710 --> 00:11:35.170
Y-Yeah...

00:11:36.090 --> 00:11:38.670
I was wondering if Futami-san came today.

00:11:39.840 --> 00:11:41.510
Futami Eriko-san?

00:11:44.970 --> 00:11:46.390
I...

00:11:46.390 --> 00:11:48.520
Haven't seen her yet today.

00:11:48.520 --> 00:11:50.350
I see. Thanks.

00:11:56.520 --> 00:11:57.570
You're late, Aihara!

00:11:58.530 --> 00:11:59.360
Sorry.

00:11:59.820 --> 00:12:00.900
Huh?

00:12:00.900 --> 00:12:01.570
Where's Kouichi?

00:12:01.900 --> 00:12:03.160
Sanada is...

00:12:04.240 --> 00:12:06.370
Hey, you, freshman.

00:12:06.950 --> 00:12:09.080
I'm from the Movie Research Club.

00:12:09.080 --> 00:12:10.700
If you'd like, how about you watch this?

00:12:11.290 --> 00:12:13.540
No, it's nothing weird or anything.

00:12:13.540 --> 00:12:16.500
Isn't he trying a bit too hard?

00:12:16.500 --> 00:12:18.670
This is your share, Aihara.

00:12:19.550 --> 00:12:23.010
Gather some promising freshman for me, please.

00:12:23.010 --> 00:12:24.090
O-Okay.

00:12:25.550 --> 00:12:27.220
Soccer is really fun!

00:12:27.220 --> 00:12:29.180
How about at least participating in our practices?

00:12:29.140 --> 00:12:31.020
Calligraphy Club

00:12:30.180 --> 00:12:32.020
We're the Movie Research Club!

00:12:32.020 --> 00:12:34.100
We're handing out DVDs!

00:12:34.100 --> 00:12:36.480
Kick a ball and relieve your stress!

00:12:36.480 --> 00:12:38.360
How about joining the Soccer Club?

00:12:42.190 --> 00:12:43.240
Aihara-kun!

00:12:44.910 --> 00:12:47.530
Hey, what are you doing here?

00:12:47.530 --> 00:12:49.370
W-What am I doing?

00:12:49.370 --> 00:12:50.990
Inviting new members for the Movie Research Club.

00:12:51.290 --> 00:12:53.460
If you're inviting, help us then!

00:12:53.460 --> 00:12:55.540
You're a member of the Soccer Club too, right?

00:12:55.540 --> 00:12:58.590
Even if you don't do anything, new members will join the Soccer Club anyways, right?

00:12:59.340 --> 00:13:01.510
And besides, I'm just a substitute.

00:13:02.090 --> 00:13:03.800
That doesn't matter!

00:13:03.800 --> 00:13:05.090
It's a teamwork problem!

00:13:05.090 --> 00:13:08.100
W-Well, we only have three members.

00:13:08.100 --> 00:13:09.720
I've got to help them.

00:13:10.510 --> 00:13:11.350
Onii-chan!

00:13:12.350 --> 00:13:13.810
Hey, onii-chan!

00:13:16.140 --> 00:13:18.860
Nice to meet you, Aihara-senpai.

00:13:18.860 --> 00:13:21.610
I'm Satonaka Narumi from 1st Year Class A.

00:13:21.610 --> 00:13:23.490
She's Naru-chan from the same class!

00:13:23.490 --> 00:13:25.240
We became friends!

00:13:25.240 --> 00:13:26.280
Right?

00:13:27.160 --> 00:13:28.160
Look!

00:13:28.160 --> 00:13:30.830
Naru-chan's frog is a girl.

00:13:30.830 --> 00:13:32.660
She's called Juliet-chan.

00:13:32.950 --> 00:13:35.120
Wait, that's...

00:13:35.540 --> 00:13:38.080
She's Iwao-kun's lover now!

00:13:38.790 --> 00:13:40.040
So...

00:13:40.340 --> 00:13:44.380
Why is Juliet-chan in an udon strainer?

00:13:46.130 --> 00:13:48.640
Yes, that! As expected of you, onii-chan!

00:13:48.640 --> 00:13:50.760
How observant! I'm amazed you noticed!

00:13:50.760 --> 00:13:51.890
Is she trying to compliment me?

00:13:52.140 --> 00:13:56.480
Naru-chan's goal is to make Japan's most delicious udon!

00:13:56.480 --> 00:14:00.230
That's why we're going to make an udon association!

00:14:00.230 --> 00:14:02.320
Please come by and eat sometime!

00:14:02.770 --> 00:14:04.570
Udon association?

00:14:04.820 --> 00:14:08.820
So, I'm sorry, but I can't join the Movie Research Club.

00:14:08.820 --> 00:14:10.570
Sorry.

00:14:12.780 --> 00:14:15.750
I thought I finally got her to join, but now she got away...

00:14:16.290 --> 00:14:17.870
What am I going to tell Hiiragi?

00:14:20.130 --> 00:14:21.130
Sorry, Nana!

00:14:21.130 --> 00:14:22.670
Just randomly hand these out for me!

00:14:23.590 --> 00:14:25.840
Onii-chan! Where are you going?!

00:14:30.390 --> 00:14:33.760
This school is pretty enthusiastic about clubs.

00:14:34.850 --> 00:14:36.930
See you, Mizusawa-san!

00:14:36.930 --> 00:14:37.930
See you tomorrow!

00:14:38.310 --> 00:14:39.310
Yeah!

00:14:40.350 --> 00:14:41.400
I see.

00:14:41.400 --> 00:14:43.360
Third years are in the Go-Home Club.

00:14:43.360 --> 00:14:45.320
They probably go to cram school.

00:14:46.110 --> 00:14:47.440
Ah, I'm going to be late!

00:14:49.400 --> 00:14:50.740
They <i>do</i> have entrance exams.

00:14:51.530 --> 00:14:54.790
All right! I guess I'll go see what Kouichi and Kazuki are up to!

00:15:27.280 --> 00:15:28.570
You're good!

00:15:30.650 --> 00:15:33.820
Um... You're Kai-kun, right?

00:15:33.820 --> 00:15:35.580
That's a sax, right?

00:15:35.580 --> 00:15:37.410
Do you always practice here?

00:15:38.910 --> 00:15:40.500
Huh? You're not practicing anymore?

00:15:43.080 --> 00:15:45.000
You don't need to be in such a rush to go home!

00:15:46.550 --> 00:15:48.380
Do you hate me that much?

00:15:49.170 --> 00:15:51.300
I told you that we can't get along.

00:15:51.550 --> 00:15:54.260
You won't know that until we talk!

00:15:57.010 --> 00:15:58.970
Are you taking entrance exams?

00:15:58.970 --> 00:15:59.470
You're taking them, right?

00:16:01.600 --> 00:16:03.520
Um, probably...

00:16:03.900 --> 00:16:05.270
I'm not.

00:16:07.360 --> 00:16:08.610
It's not just you.

00:16:09.400 --> 00:16:11.900
The others don't do anything but talk about exams.

00:16:12.700 --> 00:16:15.370
It's a real bother... trying to have a conversation with them.

00:16:16.410 --> 00:16:19.080
If you're not taking entrance exams, what are you going to do?

00:16:21.000 --> 00:16:21.750
A contest.

00:16:24.790 --> 00:16:27.040
So, that's why you're practicing!

00:16:28.000 --> 00:16:28.960
Could it be...

00:16:29.880 --> 00:16:32.420
You're aiming to become a professional musician?

00:16:34.430 --> 00:16:35.720
That's cool!

00:16:36.760 --> 00:16:39.850
It's great that you have a dream like that!

00:16:40.890 --> 00:16:41.980
I see! I see!

00:16:42.560 --> 00:16:44.310
I have a better view of you now.

00:16:45.560 --> 00:16:47.270
Okay then, I'll promise you.

00:16:48.440 --> 00:16:52.030
When I talk to you, I won't mention entrance exams at all.

00:16:52.030 --> 00:16:56.030
I wouldn't want to talk about it either when it's brought up.

00:16:56.030 --> 00:16:58.450
A year full of only entrance exams would be boring.

00:16:59.660 --> 00:17:01.790
I want a lot of friends, too!

00:17:01.790 --> 00:17:02.910
I want to fall in love, too!

00:17:03.460 --> 00:17:04.830
You're quite a strange one.

00:17:04.830 --> 00:17:06.670
Anyways, I promise you.

00:17:06.670 --> 00:17:10.000
In exchange, talk to me too, Kai-kun.

00:17:10.000 --> 00:17:12.550
I hate being ignored the most.

00:17:13.920 --> 00:17:14.550
Okay.

00:17:15.260 --> 00:17:16.130
I got it.

00:17:17.590 --> 00:17:18.430
I'm glad!

00:17:27.100 --> 00:17:29.940
I thought it flew out from here, but...

00:17:35.820 --> 00:17:36.530
Futami-san!

00:17:38.110 --> 00:17:39.570
You came!

00:17:39.570 --> 00:17:40.740
I thought you took the day off!

00:17:41.120 --> 00:17:41.910
Me?

00:17:42.540 --> 00:17:43.330
Why?

00:17:43.790 --> 00:17:45.750
You weren't in your classroom.

00:17:45.750 --> 00:17:47.920
You didn't attend the entrance ceremony, either.

00:17:48.790 --> 00:17:50.420
You were looking for me?

00:17:52.840 --> 00:17:54.420
You're not very attentive.

00:17:56.130 --> 00:17:57.800
Even though you found the paper airplane.

00:18:05.350 --> 00:18:06.560
Didn't you notice it?

00:18:07.190 --> 00:18:08.440
No, I didn't.

00:18:09.600 --> 00:18:10.730
Did you want something from me?

00:18:11.730 --> 00:18:14.650
Ah, I wanted to talk to you, Futami-san.

00:18:14.990 --> 00:18:16.240
About what?

00:18:16.610 --> 00:18:17.240
About...

00:18:18.070 --> 00:18:19.910
What happened yesterday.

00:18:19.910 --> 00:18:22.490
I was wondering why you suddenly did that.

00:18:23.620 --> 00:18:24.490
About the kiss?

00:18:26.620 --> 00:18:27.290
Yeah.

00:18:27.960 --> 00:18:28.750
It was an experiment.

00:18:29.000 --> 00:18:30.580
What kind of experiment?

00:18:31.250 --> 00:18:33.590
We just met yesterday.

00:18:33.590 --> 00:18:36.380
I don't think kissing is something to experiment on.

00:18:36.630 --> 00:18:40.050
I want to get to know you more, naturally.

00:18:40.050 --> 00:18:41.640
I see, I've got it.

00:18:43.350 --> 00:18:44.430
The experiment is over.

00:18:45.470 --> 00:18:46.930
There's no point in forcing you to continue.

00:18:47.600 --> 00:18:48.810
Futami-san...

00:18:49.480 --> 00:18:50.560
Is that all you wanted to talk about?

00:18:51.860 --> 00:18:53.570
Well, I guess...

00:18:54.150 --> 00:18:55.690
Goodbye, Aihara.

00:19:03.700 --> 00:19:05.660
If you'd like, at least come observe.

00:19:06.330 --> 00:19:08.200
Ah, sorry. I'm not interested.

00:19:13.080 --> 00:19:15.460
Excuse me! I'm from the Movie Research Club!

00:19:19.470 --> 00:19:20.300
Sanada-kun!

00:19:20.550 --> 00:19:21.430
S-Sorry.

00:19:23.510 --> 00:19:24.600
I thought you were a freshman...

00:19:28.560 --> 00:19:30.600
Are you going home now, Hoshino-san?

00:19:32.690 --> 00:19:33.480
Yes.

00:19:34.020 --> 00:19:34.650
I see.

00:19:37.190 --> 00:19:38.150
There he is!

00:19:38.990 --> 00:19:39.570
Kou---!

00:19:42.320 --> 00:19:43.370
I thought...

00:19:47.490 --> 00:19:50.080
You didn't know my name, Sanada-kun.

00:19:52.080 --> 00:19:52.790
Well...

00:19:53.830 --> 00:19:56.170
We were in the same class in first year.

00:19:56.590 --> 00:19:59.710
But we never talked to each other before.

00:19:59.710 --> 00:20:01.720
I don't really stand out.

00:20:02.130 --> 00:20:03.050
That's not true!

00:20:06.970 --> 00:20:07.680
Nothing...

00:20:14.940 --> 00:20:16.230
Healing Beam.

00:20:18.820 --> 00:20:20.820
I'm being healed...

00:20:21.320 --> 00:20:23.780
This DVD is so entertaining!

00:20:23.780 --> 00:20:25.820
Do your best, Kuma-chan!

00:20:25.820 --> 00:20:28.740
Get the gorilla! Go!

00:20:29.120 --> 00:20:31.700
Spill it already!

00:20:31.960 --> 00:20:35.670
S-She's just a classmate!

00:20:35.670 --> 00:20:37.960
She was a cute girl.

00:20:37.960 --> 00:20:39.500
What's her name?

00:20:39.920 --> 00:20:42.050
Ho-Hoshino...

00:20:42.050 --> 00:20:43.010
Yuumi.

00:20:43.590 --> 00:20:45.050
So she's Yuumi-chan.

00:20:45.590 --> 00:20:49.680
Maybe I'll tell Yuumi-chan all your embarrassing stories?

00:20:50.180 --> 00:20:51.850
D-Don't!

00:20:51.850 --> 00:20:54.140
So you do like her!

00:20:54.140 --> 00:20:55.770
How far have you gotten?

00:20:56.730 --> 00:20:58.860
We're nothing like that, yet.

00:21:00.650 --> 00:21:02.610
We were in the same class last year but,

00:21:02.610 --> 00:21:05.360
today was the first time we really talked.

00:21:05.360 --> 00:21:06.450
What?

00:21:07.280 --> 00:21:09.450
What's that?

00:21:09.450 --> 00:21:11.370
What the heck were you doing that year?

00:21:12.160 --> 00:21:13.660
Even if you say that...

00:21:14.710 --> 00:21:17.750
I don't have any confidence and I don't know what to say...

00:21:18.710 --> 00:21:20.750
How pathetic.

00:21:20.750 --> 00:21:24.920
If you can't say something cool, you won't be able to become a novelist.

00:21:26.590 --> 00:21:27.260
Mao-neechan!

00:21:27.970 --> 00:21:29.510
You remembered?

00:21:29.930 --> 00:21:31.510
All right, leave it to me.

00:21:32.810 --> 00:21:36.770
remembered my name.

00:21:32.810 --> 00:21:35.060
kowaresou de

00:21:32.810 --> 00:21:35.060
It looks like it’s about to fall apart.

00:21:35.390 --> 00:21:39.020
taisetsu sugite sawarenakatta

00:21:35.390 --> 00:21:39.020
So precious that I couldn’t touch it.

00:21:39.360 --> 00:21:41.730
wasarenai yo

00:21:39.360 --> 00:21:41.730
I won’t forget

00:21:41.730 --> 00:21:45.200
In order for you to become a cool guy that Yuumi-chan will fall for,

00:21:42.780 --> 00:21:47.490
hoshi ni negai o

00:21:42.780 --> 00:21:47.490
that wish upon a star.

00:21:45.200 --> 00:21:47.030
I'm going to train you hard!

00:21:47.030 --> 00:21:48.410
Prepare yourself!

00:21:55.710 --> 00:22:00.210
kyou shitsu no sumi ni wa itsumo fushigi bako

00:21:55.710 --> 00:22:00.210
The strange box lying in the corner of the classroom;

00:22:00.250 --> 00:22:02.590
dare ni mo misenai shi

00:22:00.250 --> 00:22:02.590
I won’t show it to anyone.

00:22:02.960 --> 00:22:05.380
itsumo minai furi

00:22:02.960 --> 00:22:05.380
I always pretend not to see it.

00:22:06.720 --> 00:22:11.300
hajimete okutte moratta hoshi no yoru

00:22:06.720 --> 00:22:11.300
The first time you walked me home during that starry night.

00:22:11.300 --> 00:22:13.680
ano kajitsu mo

00:22:11.300 --> 00:22:13.680
The fruit

00:22:14.100 --> 00:22:16.270
mada tabetenai kedo

00:22:14.100 --> 00:22:16.270
I have not eaten.

00:22:16.810 --> 00:22:19.100
honki de butsukatta

00:22:16.810 --> 00:22:19.100
I struck it with all my might.

00:22:19.690 --> 00:22:21.900
naite sawaida

00:22:19.690 --> 00:22:21.900
I cried and I screamed.

00:22:22.110 --> 00:22:30.410
shinkei wa kitto kinui totokoutetsu de dekiteta

00:22:22.110 --> 00:22:30.410
I’m certain nerves are made from silk and steel.

00:22:30.740 --> 00:22:33.030
osaekirenai

00:22:30.740 --> 00:22:33.030
My insuppressible feelings

00:22:33.330 --> 00:22:37.040
omoi o nagete negai boshi ni

00:22:33.330 --> 00:22:37.040
are cast on a wishing star.

00:22:37.290 --> 00:22:38.670
ima kakeru yo

00:22:37.290 --> 00:22:38.670
It’s now time to run.

00:22:38.830 --> 00:22:42.090
tobira no soto wa DAIAMONDO

00:22:38.830 --> 00:22:42.090
Beyond the door are diamonds.

00:22:42.130 --> 00:22:48.050
ikusen no yume kaki utsushita NOOTO ni

00:22:42.130 --> 00:22:48.050
Thousands of dreams transcribed onto a notebook.

00:22:48.300 --> 00:22:53.140
tojikometara ai ni yuku yo

00:22:48.300 --> 00:22:53.140
Whenever I’m trapped I’m go see you.

00:22:53.140 --> 00:22:59.100
kirakira toeien o kiritotta mamade

00:22:53.140 --> 00:22:59.100
The sparkle and eternity are cut short.

00:22:59.350 --> 00:23:04.070
yakusoku shita kimi to nara ano hi no KISU o

00:22:59.350 --> 00:23:04.070
We made a promise with a kiss on that day.

00:23:04.190 --> 00:23:06.110
kowaresou de

00:23:04.190 --> 00:23:06.110
It looks like it’s about to fall apart.

00:23:06.400 --> 00:23:10.070
taisetsu sugite sawarenakatta

00:23:06.400 --> 00:23:10.070
So precious that I couldn’t touch it.

00:23:10.360 --> 00:23:13.160
wasurenai yo

00:23:10.360 --> 00:23:13.160
I won’t forget

00:23:13.830 --> 00:23:19.120
hoshi ni negai o

00:23:13.830 --> 00:23:19.120
that wish upon a star.

00:23:25.130 --> 00:23:40.140
Next Episode

00:23:25.880 --> 00:23:29.010
What do you mean you're going to make me into a cool guy?

00:23:29.300 --> 00:23:31.280
What's she planning to do?

00:23:31.520 --> 00:23:33.030
I'm really worried.

00:23:34.280 --> 00:23:36.560
The girl I admire is going to be at the karaoke party?!

00:23:36.990 --> 00:23:38.600
This is a chance!
